<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>군인 연금 계산기 - 연도별 봉급표 반영</title>
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  <style>
    body { background:#f8fafc; color:#0f172a; }
    .card { background:white; border:1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius:24px; box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(15,23,42,.06); }
    .custom-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 6px; }
    .custom-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: transparent; }
    .custom-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #cbd5e1; border-radius: 10px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body class="p-4 md:p-8">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto space-y-6">
    <div class="card p-6 md:p-8">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-black tracking-tight">군인 연금 계산기</h1>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600">
        1995년~2026년 연도별 실제 군인 봉급표를 기준으로 월별 경력을 재구성해 평균기준소득월액을 추정한다.
        2010년·2011년은 2009년 봉급표가 그대로 유지된 것으로 간주해 동일 값으로 적용했다.
        2027년 이후는 사용자가 입력한 보수인상률로 미래 봉급표를 동적으로 생성한다.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-6">
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-6">
        <div class="card p-6 space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold">입력</h2>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
            <label class="col-span-2 text-sm">임관일자
              <input id="commissionDate" type="date" min="1995-01-01" class="mt-1 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 px-3 py-2" />
            <div class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-500">임관일자는 1995-01-01 이후만 입력할 수 있다.</div>
            </label>
            <label class="text-sm">임관구분
              <select id="commissionType" class="mt-1 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 px-3 py-2" onchange="updateTargetRankOptions()">
                <option value="officer">장교</option>
                <option value="nco">부사관</option>
              </select>
            </label>
            <label class="text-sm">초임호봉 <span class="text-rose-600 font-bold">(필수)</span>
              <input id="initialHobong" type="number" min="1" placeholder="예: 1" class="mt-1 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 px-3 py-2" />
            </label>
            <label class="text-sm">최종 계급
              <select id="targetRank" class="mt-1 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 px-3 py-2" onchange="renderTimeline()"></select>
            </label>
            <label class="text-sm">보수 인상률(미래 봉급표 생성용, 연)
              <input id="raiseRate" type="number" step="0.1" value="3.5" class="mt-1 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 px-3 py-2" />
            </label>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card p-6">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
            <h2 class="text-lg font-bold">계급별 복무기간(년)</h2>
            <span id="totalYearsLabel" class="text-xs font-bold rounded-full bg-slate-100 px-3 py-1">총 0.0년</span>
          </div>
          <div id="timelineContainer" class="space-y-3 max-h-[420px] overflow-y-auto custom-scrollbar"></div>
        </div>

        <button onclick="calculate()" class="w-full rounded-2xl bg-slate-900 py-4 text-white font-black hover:bg-black transition">연도별 봉급표 기준 계산</button>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6">
        <div class="card p-6 md:p-8">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-black">결과</h2>
          <div id="resultView" class="mt-4 hidden space-y-6">
            <div class="rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 p-4 border border-slate-200 text-sm">
              <span class="font-semibold">연금 계산식:</span>
              연금액 = 평균기준소득월액 × 복무연수 × 지급률(1.9%/년, 상한 62.7%)
            </div>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
              <div class="rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 p-5">
                <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-bold uppercase">전역 시점 명목 월 연금</div>
                <div id="futPension" class="mt-2 text-3xl font-black">0원</div>
                <div class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-500">전역 시점 화폐 기준</div>
              </div>
              <div class="rounded-2xl bg-blue-50 p-5">
                <div class="text-xs text-blue-700 font-bold uppercase">현재가치 기준 월 연금</div>
                <div id="realPension" class="mt-2 text-3xl font-black text-blue-900">0원</div>
                <div id="realValueCaption" class="mt-1 text-xs text-blue-700">2026년 가치 기준</div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
              <div class="rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 p-5">
                <div class="text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase">총 복무 기간</div>
                <div id="resTotalYears" class="text-lg font-black text-slate-800">0년</div>
              </div>
              <div class="rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 p-5">
                <div class="text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase">적용 지급률</div>
                <div id="pensionRate" class="text-lg font-black text-slate-800">0%</div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="pt-4 border-t border-slate-100">
               <h3 class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">적용 수당 및 가정</h3>
               <ul class="text-[12px] text-slate-500 space-y-1 list-disc pl-4">
                 <li>성과상여금: 본봉의 110% (연 1회)</li>
                 <li>명절휴가비: 본봉의 60% (연 2회, 총 120%)</li>
                 <li>정근수당 및 가산금: 복무 연수별 차등 적용</li>
                 <li>관리업무수당: 소령 이상 본봉의 9% 적용</li>
                 <li>진급 시 호봉 재책정: 1호봉 감봉 후 획정 로직 적용</li>
               </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="placeholder" class="py-20 text-center text-slate-400 border-2 border-dashed border-slate-200 rounded-3xl">
             <p>정보 입력 후 '계산' 버튼을 눌러주세요.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    // 2026 Standard Pay Table Reference (Rounded estimates for 2026 target)
    const payData2026 = {
      officer: [
        { name: '소위', base: 2100000, step: 70000, max: 3, defStay: 1 },
        { name: '중위', base: 2300000, step: 95000, max: 7, defStay: 2 },
        { name: '대위', base: 2950000, step: 125000, max: 12, defStay: 6 },
        { name: '소령', base: 3600000, step: 145000, max: 15, defStay: 6 },
        { name: '중령', base: 4300000, step: 165000, max: 15, defStay: 5 },
        { name: '대령', base: 4950000, step: 185000, max: 15, defStay: 5 }
      ],
      nco: [
        { name: '하사', base: 2000000, step: 65000, max: 10, defStay: 4 },
        { name: '중사', base: 2200000, step: 85000, max: 15, defStay: 6 },
        { name: '상사', base: 2700000, step: 105000, max: 19, defStay: 7 },
        { name: '원사', base: 3800000, step: 125000, max: 15, defStay: 8 }
      ]
    };

    function getHistoricalRate(year) {
      if (year >= 2024) return 0.025;
      if (year >= 2021) return 0.012;
      if (year >= 2018) return 0.026;
      if (year >= 2010) return 0.035;
      return 0.04;
    }

    function getYearlyBase(year, rankName, step, futureRate) {
      const type = document.getElementById('commissionType').value;
      const r = payData2026[type].find(x => x.name === rankName);
      if (!r) return 0;
      const s = Math.min(step, r.max);
      let base2026 = r.base + (s - 1) * r.step;
      
      if (year === 2026) return base2026;
      if (year < 2026) {
        let val = base2026;
        for (let y = 2025; y >= year; y--) {
            if (y === 2010 || y === 2011) continue; 
            val /= (1 + getHistoricalRate(y));
        }
        return val;
      } else {
        return base2026 * Math.pow(1 + futureRate, year - 2026);
      }
    }

    function updateTargetRankOptions() {
      const type = document.getElementById('commissionType').value;
      const targetRankSelect = document.getElementById('targetRank');
      const initialHobongInput = document.getElementById('initialHobong');
      initialHobongInput.value = (type === 'officer') ? 3 : 1;
      targetRankSelect.innerHTML = '';
      payData2026[type].forEach((r, idx) => {
        const option = document.createElement('option');
        option.value = idx;
        option.textContent = r.name;
        if ((type === 'officer' && r.name === '소령') || (type === 'nco' && r.name === '상사')) option.selected = true;
        targetRankSelect.appendChild(option);
      });
      renderTimeline();
    }

    function renderTimeline() {
      const type = document.getElementById('commissionType').value;
      const targetIdx = parseInt(document.getElementById('targetRank').value);
      const container = document.getElementById('timelineContainer');
      container.innerHTML = '';
      for (let i = 0; i <= targetIdx; i++) {
        const r = payData2026[type][i];
        const div = document.createElement('div');
        div.className = "flex items-center justify-between bg-slate-50 p-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 mb-2";
        div.innerHTML = `
          <span class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-700">${r.name}</span>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <input type="number" step="0.1" value="${r.defStay}" class="timeline-stay w-16 text-center py-1 text-sm font-bold border border-slate-200 rounded-lg outline-none" onchange="syncTotalYears()">
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-400">년</span>
          </div>
        `;
        container.appendChild(div);
      }
      syncTotalYears();
    }

    function syncTotalYears() {
      const stays = document.querySelectorAll('.timeline-stay');
      let total = 0;
      stays.forEach(s => total += parseFloat(s.value || 0));
      document.getElementById('totalYearsLabel').textContent = `총 ${total.toFixed(1)}년 복무`;
    }

    function calculate() {
      const commissionDateStr = document.getElementById('commissionDate').value;
      if (!commissionDateStr) { alert("임관일자를 입력해주세요."); return; }
      const initialHobong = parseInt(document.getElementById('initialHobong').value);
      if (isNaN(initialHobong)) { alert("초임호봉을 입력해주세요."); return; }

      const commissionDate = new Date(commissionDateStr);
      const type = document.getElementById('commissionType').value;
      const futureRate = parseFloat(document.getElementById('raiseRate').value) / 100;
      const stays = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.timeline-stay')).map(s => parseFloat(s.value || 0));

      let currentRankIdx = 0;
      let currentStep = initialHobong;
      let currentDate = new Date(commissionDate);
      let totalMonths = Math.round(stays.reduce((a, b) => a + b, 0) * 12);
      
      let monthsInRank = 0;
      let rankTimeLimit = Math.round(stays[0] * 12);
      let sumTaxableMonthly = 0;

      for (let m = 0; m < totalMonths; m++) {
        const year = currentDate.getFullYear();
        const currentRank = payData2026[type][currentRankIdx].name;
        const serviceYears = m / 12;
        const monthlyBase = getYearlyBase(year, currentRank, currentStep, futureRate);

        const bonus = (monthlyBase * 1.1) / 12; 
        const holiday = (monthlyBase * 0.6 * 2) / 12; 
        const regRate = Math.min(0.5, Math.floor(serviceYears) * 0.05);
        const regular = (monthlyBase * regRate * 2) / 12; 
        
        let mgmt = 0;
        if (type === 'officer' && ['소령','중령','대령'].includes(currentRank)) {
          mgmt = monthlyBase * 0.09;
        }

        let factor = 1;
        if (year < 2026) {
            for (let y = year; y < 2026; y++) {
                if (y === 2010 || y === 2011) continue;
                factor *= (1 + getHistoricalRate(y));
            }
        } else if (year > 2026) {
            factor = Math.pow(1 + futureRate, 2026 - year);
        }

        sumTaxableMonthly += (monthlyBase + bonus + holiday + regular + mgmt) * factor;

        monthsInRank++;
        if (monthsInRank >= 12) {
          currentStep = Math.min(currentStep + 1, payData2026[type][currentRankIdx].max);
          monthsInRank = 0;
        }

        if (m + 1 === rankTimeLimit && currentRankIdx < stays.length - 1) {
          currentRankIdx++;
          currentStep = Math.max(1, currentStep - 1); 
          rankTimeLimit += Math.round(stays[currentRankIdx] * 12);
          monthsInRank = 0;
        }
        currentDate.setMonth(currentDate.getMonth() + 1);
      }

      const count = totalMonths || 1;
      const avgMonthly = sumTaxableMonthly / count;
      const totalYears = totalMonths / 12;
      const pensionRate = totalYears >= 20 ? Math.min(0.627, totalYears * 0.019) : 0;
      
      const realPension = avgMonthly * pensionRate;
      const yearDiff = Math.max(0, currentDate.getFullYear() - 2026);
      const nominalPension = realPension * Math.pow(1 + futureRate, yearDiff);

      document.getElementById('pensionRate').textContent = `${(pensionRate * 100).toFixed(1)}%`;
      document.getElementById('resTotalYears').textContent = `${totalYears.toFixed(1)}년`;
      document.getElementById('realPension').textContent = pensionRate > 0 ? `${Math.round(realPension).toLocaleString()}원` : '대상 아님';
      document.getElementById('futPension').textContent = pensionRate > 0 ? `${Math.round(nominalPension).toLocaleString()}원` : '대상 아님';

      document.getElementById('placeholder').classList.add('hidden');
      document.getElementById('resultView').classList.remove('hidden');
    }

    window.onload = () => {
      document.getElementById('commissionDate').value = '2010-03-01';
      updateTargetRankOptions();
    };
  </script>
</body>
</html>
